					description: "Short identifier for this visual, written in the same language the user is using (follow <response_language>). Must be specific and disambiguating — if the conversation has multiple visuals, this title alone should tell you which one is being referenced. Spaces and hyphens are converted to underscores automatically. Also used as the download filename."
